{"id":"nebaioth","name":"Nebaioth","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:nebaioth"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Nebaioth","text":"Height. (1.) Ishmael’s eldest son (Gen. 25:13), and the prince of an Israelitish tribe (16). He had a sister, Mahalath, who was one of Esau’s wives (Gen. 28:9; 36:3). (2.) The name of the Ishmaelite tribe descended from the above (Gen. 25:13, 18). The “rams of Nebaioth” (Isa. 60:7) are the gifts which these wandering tribes of the desert would consecrate to God."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H5032","lemma":"נְבָיוֹת","xlit":"Nᵉbâyôwth","gloss":"Nebajoth, a son of Ismael, and the country settled by hi","kjv":"Nebaioth, Nebajoth","count":5,"share":1},{"strong":"H3458","lemma":"יִשְׁמָעֵאל","xlit":"Yishmâʻêʼl","gloss":"Jishmael, the name of Abraham's oldest son, and of five","kjv":"Ishmael","count":4,"share":0.8},{"strong":"H6938","lemma":"קֵדָר","xlit":"Qêdâr","gloss":"Kedar, a son of Ishmael","kjv":"Kedar","count":3,"share":0.6},{"strong":"H110","lemma":"אַדְבְּאֵל","xlit":"ʼAdbᵉʼêl","gloss":"Adbeel, a son of Ishmael","kjv":"Adbeel","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H4017","lemma":"מִבְשָׂם","xlit":"Mibsâm","gloss":"Mibsam, the name of an Ishmaelite and of an Israelite","kjv":"Mibsam","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H8435","lemma":"תּוֹלְדָה","xlit":"tôwlᵉdâh","gloss":"descent","kjv":"birth, generations","count":2,"share":0.4}],"verses":["Gen.25.13","Gen.28.9","Gen.36.3","1Chr.1.29","Isa.60.7"],"related":[{"id":"kedar","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.273,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ishmael","type":"cooccur","shared":4,"jaccard":0.054,"why":"4 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"kedar","type":"lexical","strong":"H5032","why":"both lead with נְבָיוֹת (H5032)"},{"id":"mahalath","type":"lexical","strong":"H5032","why":"both lead with נְבָיוֹת (H5032)"},{"id":"gedaliah","type":"lexical","strong":"H3458","why":"both lead with יִשְׁמָעֵאל (H3458)"},{"id":"ishmael","type":"lexica